  "title": "GunBroker Announces Slingit Integration for AI-Powered Used Gun Workflow",
  "summary": "GunBroker.com, the world's largest online firearms marketplace, announced integration with Slingit, an AI-powered platform enabling firearm dealers to appraise, acquire, and list used guns on GunBroker.com in under five minutes. The integration streamlines the workflow from gun counter evaluation to professional marketplace listings with AI-enhanced photos and optimized descriptions.",
